  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.24.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🚀 Features\n* Let a local↔gist Diff carry its Sync pair and write only its files by @akunzai in https://github.com/akunzai/gistui/pull/531\n* Run compare, pull, and push of a Sync pair through one sync workflow by @akunzai in https://github.com/akunzai/gistui/pull/532\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n* Stop an upload when the gist changed since its preview by @akunzai in https://github.com/akunzai/gistui/pull/527\n* Leave the upload Confirm when the gist changed since its preview by @akunzai in https://github.com/akunzai/gistui/pull/528\n* Show a failed action's error on its Confirm by @akunzai in https://github.com/akunzai/gistui/pull/529\n### 📚 Documentation\n* Record why a finished action's landing stays per handler by @akunzai in https://github.com/akunzai/gistui/pull/534\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/akunzai/gistui/compare/v0.23.1...v0.24.0",
